# keys.env - your keys for the outside services the Social Media Factory can use.
#
# You do NOT need any of these to write posts, make carousels, review them, or save a
# ready-to-post folder. Add a key only when you want the feature next to it.
#
# How to fill this in: paste the value after the = sign, no spaces, no quotes. Save the file.
# Then ask Claude "check my setup". Never paste a key into the chat.
# This file stays on your computer. It is never uploaded or committed.

# --- Posting and scheduling: Metricool (needs the Advanced plan or higher; the API is not on Free/Starter)
# Where: Metricool > Account settings > API. The user id is shown on the same page.
METRICOOL_USER_TOKEN=
METRICOOL_USER_ID=

# --- Clips from recordings: ElevenLabs (pay as you go, roughly 22 cents per hour of audio)
# Where: elevenlabs.io > your profile > API keys
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# --- Research: Apify (has a free plan with a small monthly credit)
# Where: console.apify.com > Settings > API & Integrations
APIFY_API_TOKEN=

# --- AI-made pictures: OpenAI (optional; carousels and cards don't need it)
# A separate OpenAI developer account with its own billing, not a ChatGPT subscription.
# Roughly 1 to 20 cents per picture, by size and quality; an estimate is shown before each one.
# Add prepaid credit with automatic top-up turned off. That limits what you can spend, though
# OpenAI may let it run slightly over before it stops.
# Where: platform.openai.com > API keys. Create a key and copy it.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Optional: if you already keep your keys in Doppler, set this to 1 and leave the rest empty
FACTORY_USE_DOPPLER=
